    "Five kinds differ by shape: plate (modal), handle (sheet), tail (coach), dark pill (toast), outlined number (pop).",
    "One palette for hub and run; scrim + cream panel carry contrast.",
    "Ads are 120 high in their own row; main buttons are 132.",
    "Run end is shown over the frozen run, not a black scene.",
    "R1 points at the coin counter instead of covering the lanes.",
    "A3 is a wrapping grid of tiles with 4 dots each.",
    "Upgrade button is the price (flower drawing ×2).",
    "Optional fall banner \"Ouch!\" (≤1 s, no button).",
    "Gift \"Back in Nh\" is a display of existing reset time."
